# Introduction

This is the API description of @CMAKE_PROJECT_NAME@ version
@CMAKE_PROJECT_VERSION@. For usage of the framework, refer to:

```txt
$ man 1 dls
```

For quick reference, the following manual page is also available:

```txt
$ man 2 dls
```

The software framework is split into different layers. While not strictly
necessary to understand the information flow in order to build a plugin, it is
briefly shown in the following diagram:

```txt
@FLOW_CHART_INCL@
```

